Description Task 7: Check if the RKE2 artifacts exist and have acceptable permissions. If the artifacts have write permissions, change them to read-only. If the install script is not executable, make it executable. If the install script is not executable and does not exist, fail the task. Only perform this task if the RKE2 airgap mode is enabled and the airgap implementation is set to 'exists'.

Task 8: Set RKE2 bin path
Description Task 8: Populate service facts, get stats of the filesystem object, check if separate partition, and set the RKE2 bin path based on the results.

